mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of water will have <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>144</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13.88</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Molality = <math><mn>13.88</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>"
